---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Green Cleaning & Management" description="Eco-conscious cleaning programs that reduce your carbon footprint without compromising on standards.">

<main>

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-primary text-white">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="mb-kenburns absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image:url('/assets/green-facility.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#192e47e6] via-[#192e47bf] to-[#192e4766]"></div>
    <div class="mb-grid-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-40"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 pt-40 lg:px-10 lg:pb-32 lg:pt-48">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-white/70">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg><span class="text-white">Green Cleaning & Management</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="mt-8 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-white/70">Pillar 02 — Sustainability</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Green Cleaning & Management</h1>
      <div class="mt-10 h-px w-24 bg-white/40"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-card py-20 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:px-10">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <div class="h-80 w-full rounded-sm bg-cover bg-center lg:h-[520px]" style="background-image:url('/assets/green-cleaning-management.avif')"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mb-fade" data-delay="120">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/85">
        <p>At Millbrooke, we believe an eco-conscious approach to our business has a direct impact on your business. Green cleaning practices have become more effective and resources more accessible than ever before, with businesses recognising the direct link to the health and wellbeing of their employees and customers. From no-phosphate detergents and scrubs to recycled paper products, our customers can have a positive impact on the environment without Millbrooke compromising on its high standards.</p>
        <p>Millbrooke will customise a 'green cleaning' plan to suit your business's needs, centred around reducing your carbon footprint and waste. We always seek to educate our workforce about better ways to achieve results while doing our part to remain environmentally-friendly — safe work environments are green work environments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
 <div class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-6xl gap-5 px-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:px-10">
  <div class="flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded-sm border border-border bg-background p-6 mb-fade" data-delay="0">
    <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-primary text-white"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"/><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"/></svg></span>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">No-Phosphate Products</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded-sm border border-border bg-background p-6 mb-fade" data-delay="60">
    <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-primary text-white"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 19H4.815a1.83 1.83 0 0 1-1.57-.881 1.785 1.785 0 0 1-.004-1.784L7.196 9.5"/><path d="M11 19h8.203a1.83 1.83 0 0 0 1.556-.89 1.784 1.784 0 0 0 0-1.775l-1.226-2.12"/><path d="m14 16-3 3 3 3"/><path d="M8.293 13.596 7.196 9.5 3.1 10.598"/><path d="m9.344 5.811 1.093-1.892A1.83 1.83 0 0 1 11.985 3a1.784 1.784 0 0 1 1.546.888l3.943 6.843"/><path d="m13.378 9.633 4.096 1.098 1.097-4.096"/></svg></span>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Waste Reduction</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded-sm border border-border bg-background p-6 mb-fade" data-delay="120">
    <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-primary text-white"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 16v-2.38C4 11.5 2.97 10.5 3 8c.03-2.72 1.49-6 4.5-6C9.37 2 10 3.8 10 5.5c0 3.11-2 5.66-2 8.68V16a2 2 0 1 1-4 0Z"/><path d="M20 20v-2.38c0-2.12 1.03-3.12 1-5.62-.03-2.72-1.49-6-4.5-6C14.63 6 14 7.8 14 9.5c0 3.11 2 5.66 2 8.68V20a2 2 0 1 0 4 0Z"/><path d="M16 17h4"/><path d="M4 13h4"/></svg></span>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Carbon Footprint Focus</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-4 rounded-sm border border-border bg-background p-6 mb-fade" data-delay="180">
    <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-primary text-white"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"/><path d="M22 10v6"/><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"/></svg></span>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Eco-Educated Workforce</p>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-primary text-white">
  <div class="mb-grid-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-30"></div>
  <div class="absolute -right-32 top-1/2 h-[500px] w-[500px] -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(74,111,165,0.7), transparent 70%)"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-start gap-8 px-6 py-20 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-white/60">Get in touch</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Want a greener approach for your facility?</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact" class="group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-primary transition-all hover:bg-white/90 hover:shadow-2xl">Contact Us <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"/><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

</Layout>